      "correctOptionId": "A",
      "correctAnswerLatex": "12",
      "workedSolutionSteps": [
        "Adding gives 4x=16 so x=4.",
        "The erroneous y=8 gives 3(4)+2(8)=28; the correct y would be 2.",
        "The excess is 28−16=12."
